OL,3,GNEWSADecorated RAF pilot appeals for
OL,4,Astem cell donor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decorated RAF veteran has described
OL,7,Ffinding himself "needing help from
OL,8,Fother people" after being diagnosed
OL,9,Fwith a life-threatening blood disorder
OL,10,Fand being told he needs a stem cell
OL,11,Ftransplant.
OL,13,FFormer RAF Chinook pilot Chris Gordon,
OL,14,F43, received a medal for gallantry from
OL,15,FQueen Elizabeth II in 2013 for his work
OL,16,Fsaving lives in Afghanistan.
OL,18,FNow the veteran, from Manchester, is
OL,19,Flaunching an appeal for a stem cell
OL,20,Fdonor after being diagnosed with severe
OL,21,Faplastic anaemia, an extremely rare
OL,22,Fblood disorder.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
